\Gamma_{c,p}&={\frac{\partial\Delta_{c,p}}{\partial S}}={\frac{\partial^{2}V_{c,p}}{\partial S^{2}}}=e^{-q\tau}{\frac{\phi(d_{1})}{S\sigma{\sqrt{\tau}}}}=Ke^{-r\tau}{\frac{\phi(d_{2})}{S^{2}\sigma{\sqrt{\tau}}}}
